  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following set is having correct statements?<br />\r<math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is a weak base<br />\r<math> <mrow> <mtext>2</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> oxidizes Fe (II) to Fe (III)<br />\r<math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> can be obtained by the electrolysis of conc. <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />\r<math> <mrow> <mtext>4</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> reduces Mn (VII) to Mn (II)"
